  constraint on our 0.005 gap to the teacher, this should close it at 400% of the
  teacher''s size. It is expected NOT to, and that negative result is the point: it
  would show the ceiling is the teacher''s knowledge rather than the student''s capacity,
  which is the claim the next round of work rests on. Nothing at this size can be
  shipped -- ~69 us/row on the fused path at v026 already projects past the grader''s
  60-min target, and this is 2x that.'
